.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent workspace: screenshot drivers, UI measurement scripts, verification
# captures and the written pass log. Kept on disk because they are the only way
# to verify GUI behaviour (AGENTS.md refers to the tools by name) -- but not
# tracked. They are regenerated every iteration, the capture set alone runs to
# tens of MB, and they are noise to anyone reading the repo.
.workbuddy-ai/

# Local reference images and scratch captures. Snor ships no raster assets --
# fonts live in assets/fonts -- so nothing here is needed to build or run.
# If a real PNG asset is ever added, negate it explicitly with `!path/to.png`.
*.png

# Curated README screenshots are the one exception: they are small, chosen,
# and linked from README.md. Everything else PNG stays untracked.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
